  <running_head>EVANGELI. SECULI. IV.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">tholica non sit, iniquè nobiscum agit</l>
    <l n="2">Harscherus, si dicat nos ecclesiam ca-</l>
    <l n="3">tholicam impugnare; quicquid sectarii,</l>
    <l n="4">Mahumetani, Pseudochristi &amp; Anti-</l>
    <l n="5">christi faciant.</l>
    <l n="6" type="heading" level="2" para="true">II. Quod nullum admittunt catholicum</l>
    <l n="7" type="heading" level="2">scripturæ sacræ intellectum.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Intellectum sacræ scripturæ catholi-</l>
    <l n="9">cum voco, qui iuxta constantem &amp;</l>
    <l n="10">perpetuam scripturæ sententiam, ex</l>
    <l n="11">eiusdem apertis &amp; minimè obscuris lo-</l>
    <l n="12">cis traditur: catholicus igitur dicitur,</l>
    <l n="13">tum propter fidem catholicam, cui est</l>
    <l n="14">analogus, tum propter consensum to-</l>
    <l n="15">tius scripturæ sacræ.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Huiusmodi intellectus sacræ scriptu-</l>
    <l n="17">ræ continetur in symbolis catholicis,</l>
    <l n="18">Apostolico, Niceno, Constantinopoli-</l>
    <l n="19">tano, Athanasiano, Ephesino, Chalce-</l>
    <l n="20">donensi. Quæ sine controversia à no-</l>
    <l n="21">bis admittuntur &amp; recipiuntur. Non</l>
    <l n="22">quidem quatenus ab hominibus con-</l>
    <l n="23">cinnata,</l>
  </main_text>
